      "explanation_markdown": "**Evaluate.** $$\\int_0^{7} x \\, dx.$$\n\n**Step 1 — Antiderivative.** $$\\int x\\,dx = \\dfrac{x^2}{2}.$$\n\n**Step 2 — Apply the limits $0$ to $7$.** $$\\left[\\dfrac{x^2}{2}\\right]_0^{7} = \\dfrac{7^2}{2} - \\dfrac{0^2}{2}.$$\n\n**Step 3 — Simplify.** $$= \\dfrac{7^2}{2} = 24.5.$$\n\n**Answer.** $24.5$.",
